# Note: `.mcp.json` at repo root IS checked in — it's the project-scope MCP
# manifest (a generic `{ "command": "vulcan", "args": ["mcp"] }` block, no
# user-specific paths). Per-user MCP state lives in `~/.claude.json` (under
# `projects.<path>.mcpServers`) and is outside this tree. For personal
# overrides that shouldn't be shared, use `.mcp.local.json`.
.mcp.local.json
